{
  "id": "subliminal-perception",
  "term": "subliminal perception",
  "definition": "Subliminal perception is the influence of a stimulus on thinking, feelings, actions, learning, or memory without the person being consciously aware of the stimulus. It involves input that is below subjective awareness and can still shape responses, such as making reactions faster or more accurate when later information matches the unseen cue.",
